{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画『あさひなぐ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/27/7341733/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野桜井と大阪京都名古屋の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台挨拶をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肉！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日舞台挨拶で薙刀を教えてくださった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生、生徒さんがいらっしゃったとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず泣いてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間、、ではなかったな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり薙刀を一から習うのは大変だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えりと共に仲間の大切さを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実感した撮影期間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"至らない点もあると思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間、そして薙刀と向き合いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/27/7341733/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不器用ながらも逃げないで闘う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなを、部長をぜひ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その目で見届けてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/27/7341733/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビッグコミックスピリッツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/27/7341733/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"検索がいらないサロン予約アプリ「リクポ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PRキャラクター大使に就任致しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの17th個人PV「伊藤まりかっと。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が特典映像から飛び出してCMデビューです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"WEBCMですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原宿でガンガン流れてるみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すげえええ！よかったね！まりかっと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/m7m0f7e7Llk"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知っている人も知らない人も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間限定フルバージョンもチェックして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひリクポ予約でまりかっとしましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかっとみんなおぼえて歌ってくれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記者会見で記者さんに紛れて座ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかチームの福島監督と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松浦プロデューサーを見つけましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運動会で子供にカメラを向ける"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんみたいだった、、！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんたる安心感！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/27/7341733/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.20周年おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『伊藤万理華の脳内博覧会』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆GALLERY X BY PARCO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月5日〜15日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"